JS8Call extension for Web-888/RaspSDR Kiwi server
==================================================

Browser-side JS8Call decoder extension. Decoding is done entirely in the
browser using a pure-JavaScript Web Worker (dist/js8_worker.js) that
implements the complete decode chain (Bluestein FFT, sync, LLR, LDPC,
message unpack). There is no WASM dependency and no third-party decoder
code is shipped.

